ic papers across up to 8 sources (OpenAlex, Semantic Scholar, CrossRef, PubMed, arXiv; OpenReview for AI venues; NSSD 国家哲社文献中心 + yiigle 中华医学期刊), from Quick scan to Audit prep. Use to run a literature search, gather references, scope a topic, search Chinese/中文原生 literature (中文文献/中文核心/CSSCI/C刊/国内研究/中华××期刊/心理学报/经济研究), filter by journal tier (中科院分区/一区/几区, Q1, JCR/SJR quartile, 影响因子/impact factor, 顶刊/top journal, 按分区筛), or export paste-ready boolean search strategies/检索式 for external databases (PubMed/WOS/Scopus/Embase/PsycINFO/知网 CNKI/万方/SinoMed: 写检索式/导出检索式/知网专业检索). Triggers: scoping/systematic review, SR prep, literature review, 'help me write a lit review', 找文献/找论文/论文搜索/学术检索/文献检索/文献综述/综述前期/求文献/找中文的. Outputs HTML report + BibTeX/RIS/CSV + PRISMA-S log. Do NOT use for concept explanations ('what is X'/'X 是什么', e.g. '影响因子怎么算'), writing ('帮我写'/'help me write a paragraph'), interpreting one paper or PDF download (use paper-downloader-portable), or an existing literature set (use literature-set-review).\"\nlicense: Apache-2.0\nallowed-tools: Bash, Read, Write, Edit, Glob, Grep, Task\nmetadata:\n  author: Bo\n  version: 2.5.0\n  vendored-from: futurehouse/paper-qa (Apache 2.0)", "declared_name": "paper-search-pro", "format_status": "header_present_not_schema_validated"}
